			if broom = 3: 'Another with multiple sclerosis? Forgot where to go? You need to go to the room balcony. Come on fast!'
			if broom = 4: 'Another with multiple sclerosis? Forgot where to go? You need to go to the room office. Come on fast!'
			if broom = 5: 'Another with multiple sclerosis? Forgot where to go? You need to go to the room dancefloor. Come on fast!'
